{"id": 93963, "field": "objectives", "ja": "Stormwind KeepのRandal Emersonと話し、さらなる指示を受けてください。受けた指示に従って、King Magni Bronzebeard、High Tinker Mekkatorque、Tyrande Whisperwindを探し出して話してください。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q-quest-objectives-02-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "80cbe7b704e5998a", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70170"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 93963, "field": "description", "ja": "Stormwind、Ironforge、Darnassusには、それぞれ独自の民と文化があります。ここAzerothのAllianceの客人として、我々の首都を順に訪ねる時間を取るとよいでしょう。\n\nまずは南の控えの間にいるRandal Emersonに道を聞いてください。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q-quest-description-02-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "7db457d1a97af1b7", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70170"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
